OL,3,ANew Zealand PM says election 'too close
OL,4,Ato call' with result yet to be declared
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 99% of votes have been
OL,7,Fcounted in New Zealand, with PM
OL,8,FChristopher Luxon saying the election
OL,9,Fis "too close to call" - see
OL,10,Fpreliminary results
OL,12,FLuxon, who leads the centre-right
OL,13,FNational Party, tells supporters the
OL,14,F"final shape of government" won't be
OL,15,Fclear until later this month - here's
OL,16,Fwhy there's a wait
OL,18,FEarlier, Luxon's main opponent,
OL,19,FLabour's Chris Hipkins, said the people
OL,20,Fof New Zealand had spoken - but "it may
OL,21,Ftake a bit longer to work out what
OL,22,Fthey've said"
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
